# sine-finally.trk -- "Sine, Finally", Headless track 8. 66 BPM, D minor
# into D major, 16 rows per bar, 36 bars.
# A 8 piano | B 8 + Surge Sine keys | C 8 D major, both | D 8 Surge alone |
# coda 4: the piano's last chord, and the bare init saw from track 1 on D.

track harm note cva cvb        # 1  chord; the Sine keys' three voices
track lh   note vel from harm  # 2  piano left hand
track mel  note vel            # 3  piano melody
track sine note vel            # 4  Surge Sine, the melody in D
track ped  cva                 # 5  pedal
track kgate note               # 6  Sine keys strike per chord
track last note vel            # 7  the init saw's single note

pattern harm_a 8x16 harm kgate ped
